[Exit Hecate]

[Enter Puck]

Lady Macbeth:
 Is Horatio more bold than the product of a normal little furry black cat and a little furry black cat?

Puck:
 If so, let us proceed to scene @MASON_SET_SLICE_ONE_REVERSE_COUNT.

Puck:
 If not, let us proceed to scene @MASON_SET_SHORT_REVERSE_COUNT.


                    Scene @MASON_SET_SLICE_ONE_REVERSE_COUNT: @LIT.scenes.MASON_SET_SLICE_ONE_REVERSE_COUNT.title

Lady Macbeth:
 You are as villainous as the sum of a little furry black cat and a cat.

Lady Macbeth:
 You are as bold as the product of yourself and the sum of the product of a normal little furry black cat and a black cat and the sum of a black cat and a cat.

Lady Macbeth:
 Let us proceed to scene @HERALD_REVERSE_TOKEN_STREAM.


